Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.55,0:00:02.20,Default,Rand1,0,0,0,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.20,0:00:03.57,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.57,0:00:05.53,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,See you tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.53,0:00:07.13,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Lala-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.13,0:00:08.28,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Sophie-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.28,0:00:10.16,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Did you want to talk to me?{What did you want to talk about?}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.16,0:00:13.50,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Yeah. I wanted to talk about\Nthe two other members we need.{the remaining members}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.88,0:00:16.67,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I'd like to team up with Alomagedon,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.67,0:00:18.33,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,but what about you?{ do you think?}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.33,0:00:20.20,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.05,0:00:24.01,Default,Rand,0,0,0,,It's Aloma-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.01,0:00:26.37,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,I can see ye are stricken by fear!{I see ye are trembling in fear!}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.37,0:00:29.23,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,The Aloma Prophecy Grimoire, chapter 3, section 3:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.23,0:00:31.76,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,"Those who dare gaze into the demon's eyes...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.76,0:00:34.23,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,...shall see the flames of hell."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.23,0:00:37.73,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,She said "Everyone look at me, I'm the best."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.73,0:00:38.95,Default,Rand2,0,0,0,,You're funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.95,0:00:39.69,Default,Rand3,0,0,0,,Yeah!{or is this a fake like Scarry scream?  I'm not 100%}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.07,0:00:46.62,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,G-Gel!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.62,0:00:50.41,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Mikan's angel powers...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.92,0:00:52.55,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Um... Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.55,0:00:55.36,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,You forgot your line again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.42,0:01:00.88,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,...will cancel out the curse\Nand bring you happiness instead!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.48,0:01:06.50,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Those who go against me shall be cursed.{You'll be cursed if you go against me.}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.50,0:01:07.80,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,And you shall be eternally cursed!{Be cursed for your entire life!}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.87,0:01:10.26,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,A lifelong curse?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.26,0:01:13.89,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,May thee be thrown about by the demon's wind!{lit- May ye be thrown about by the demon's wind and scatter.}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.89,0:01:16.77,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Demon Demon Deruderu Beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.86,0:01:22.54,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,You can leave it to this angel-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.40,0:01:27.84,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,It looks like Aloma-chan has Mikan-chan\Nwrapped around her finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.84,0:01:30.69,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,It looked like her eyes were spinning around and around.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.69,0:01:35.91,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,It's possible that Kurosu-san is threatening Shiratama-san with a curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.91,0:01:37.45,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Just like what happened with Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.45,0:01:38.87,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.77,0:01:42.34,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,N-No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.71,0:01:45.44,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I may be overthinking it, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.44,0:01:49.95,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Anyway, we need to talk about recruiting two more members.{the additional members we need.}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.95,0:01:51.82,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Let's head to PriPara!{let's meet there shortly}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.82,0:01:52.54,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.16,0:01:55.14,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I'm worried about her.{There's something I'm worried about/need to check out.}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.44,0:01:56.34,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.34,0:01:57.43,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Sorry,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.43,0:01:59.44,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,but I need to go talk to them.{ I'm going to go talk to them.}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.44,0:02:01.86,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I need to make sure she's not being threatened.{lit- I can't ignore someone being threatened.}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.86,0:02:03.15,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Hold on, Manaka-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.15,0:02:05.42,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I'll be there before our concert!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.42,0:02:06.77,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Head there without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.77,0:02:08.11,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Geez.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.38,0:03:42.48,Default,Alokan,0,0,0,,Devi & En Nursery School! Kero?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.71,0:03:51.14,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Ah! There they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.14,0:03:54.38,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Aloma-chan, Mikan-chan, wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.34,0:04:00.93,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,For Manaka Lala to approach me on her own...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.93,0:04:04.52,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Have thee finally given in to my demon's charm?{given into my demon's charm?}{grovel before}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.98,0:04:07.27,Default,Mana,0,0,0,,Fillet?{uh... again, another word pun...}{give in sounds similar to fillet}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.27,0:04:09.77,Default,Mana,0,0,0,,Yeah. I love pork fillets!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.09,0:04:11.54,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Same here! Same here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.54,0:04:12.61,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.61,0:04:13.90,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Give in!{given into}{grovel before.. yada word pun}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.90,0:04:15.49,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Give up-nano!{it can also mean to put something down like your head or weapons. So maybe this since it's close but not the same like it was in Jap.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.49,0:04:17.49,Default,Miruku,0,0,0,,Kero, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.66,0:04:21.57,Default,Miruku,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.57,0:04:23.97,Default,Anko,0,0,0,,W-Wait up, Kero-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.81,0:04:32.10,Default,Miruku,0,0,0,,Anko-chan, he won't hear you if you don't yell louder.{Anko-chan, you have to yell louder otherwise he won't hear you.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.10,0:04:32.84,Default,Anko,0,0,0,,I know...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.85,0:04:37.55,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,The dog! We better go ge{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.24,0:04:42.90,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Gel!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.90,0:04:43.68,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Sit-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.39,0:04:47.91,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,That was awesome, Mikan-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.91,0:04:49.02,Default,Miruku,0,0,0,,Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.02,0:04:50.79,Default,Miruku,0,0,0,,Thanks, Onee-chan.{I dono if we go with onee-chan(s) here or if I should TL it to like.. uh, I dono yet...}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.79,0:04:51.65,Default,Anko,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.04,0:04:54.48,Default,Miruku,0,0,0,,Don't run away again, Kero.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.86,0:04:56.57,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Kero, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.57,0:04:57.70,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,There's no mistaking it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.70,0:05:01.10,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,This is the three-headed dog Cerberus!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.10,0:05:02.33,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,The hellhound.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.66,0:05:05.03,Default,Miruku,0,0,0,,It's Kero. He's our grandma's dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.03,0:05:07.42,Default,Anko,0,0,0,,And he only has one head.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.42,0:05:10.04,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,His name sounds similar to the word for frog.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.44,0:05:13.91,Default,Miruku,0,0,0,,She named him that because he looks like a frog.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.49,0:05:16.21,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,He does!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.21,0:05:17.63,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,It's Cerberus;
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.63,0:05:20.22,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,the dog who watches over hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.67,0:05:21.85,Default,Miruku,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.67,0:05:21.85,Default-Alt,Anko,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.85,0:05:22.94,Default,Miruku,0,0,0,,You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.94,0:05:25.81,Default,Miruku,0,0,0,,He's a dog that exterminated demons with Momotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.15,0:05:28.31,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Huh? Momotaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.31,0:05:29.27,Default,Miruku,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.27,0:05:32.41,Default,Miruku,0,0,0,,We're taking him for show and tell tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.41,0:05:34.46,Default,Miruku,0,0,0,,Anko-chan will be Momotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.78,0:05:37.23,Default,Miruku,0,0,0,,Miruku will be the monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.23,0:05:38.57,Default,Miruku,0,0,0,,And Kero is the dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.57,0:05:39.22,Default,Anko,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.22,0:05:40.43,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.43,0:05:41.87,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Show and tell-nano?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.87,0:05:43.48,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,I miss doing that!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.52,0:05:47.79,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Want some of this bread-nano?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.19,0:05:48.91,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Here-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.75,0:05:54.60,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Show and tell, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.60,0:05:57.21,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Tis a great opportunity to widen hell's power.{to spread / broaden}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.21,0:05:59.17,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Go see to it!{be full of energy / be in high spirits}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.47,0:06:03.15,Default,Miruku,0,0,0,,Kero doesn't get along with people he doesn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.15,0:06:03.89,Default,Anko,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.89,0:06:07.15,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,To accept only foodstuffs, how cheeky...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.15,0:06:10.10,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,I shall place a charm upon thee to compel thy obedience.{I'll place a charm on you to show obedience to me.}{this is like place him under a spell / enchant him}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.46,0:06:13.86,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Demon Demon Deruderu Beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.86,0:06:17.32,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Now, Cerberus, show thine loyalty...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.80,0:06:19.28,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Loyalty...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.84,0:06:23.77,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Go ahead...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.92,0:06:33.13,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,He{She} did it!{He accepted!}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.13,0:06:35.58,Default,Miruku,0,0,0,,Wow! That was amazing, Onee-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.58,0:06:36.38,Default,Anko,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.42,0:06:39.88,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Don't take a demon's charm lightly.{again - this is like place him under a spell / enchant him}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.19,0:06:41.58,Default,Miruku,0,0,0,,Demons are awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.58,0:06:42.84,Default,Anko,0,0,0,,Charms are awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.84,0:06:45.38,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Ye shall be my little demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.38,0:06:46.07,Default,Miruki,0,0,0,,Little?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.07,0:06:47.24,Default,Anko,0,0,0,,Demons?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.24,0:06:48.47,Default,Miruku,0,0,0,,Is it scary?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.47,0:06:49.81,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,It's a lot of fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.16,0:06:51.34,Default,Miruku,0,0,0,,Okay then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.34,0:06:51.98,Default,Anko,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.98,0:06:57.14,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,All right, as little demons,\Nye must not perform as Momotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.14,0:07:01.49,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Weaving in a story about hell shall make it a thousand times more captivating!{If you mix in a story about hell, it will be thousands of times more interesting!}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.78,0:07:03.01,Default,Miruku,0,0,0,,How do we do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.01,0:07:03.95,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Very well.{all right then}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.95,0:07:08.33,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Allow me to share a secret passage from my prophecies grimoire.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.33,0:07:10.91,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,It is about a demon who collaborated with an ogre.{Let me share a secret passage from my prophecy grimoire about a demon and ogre who worked together.}{Let me tell you a special passage from my prophecy grimore about a demon and an ogre who worked together.}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.91,0:07:13.87,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Aloma Prophecy Grimoire, Chapter 13:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.43,0:07:19.15,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Oh, that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.15,0:07:20.42,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,What a cute drawing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.44,0:07:22.13,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,D-{\alpha&HFF&}Don't look!{alpha timing? =D}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.13,0:07:23.42,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,D-Don't look!{alpha timing? =D}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.42,0:07:24.22,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.39,0:07:28.31,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,My prophecy grimoire is not for thine wandering eyes!{Don't just go looking at my prophecy grimore!}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.61,0:07:31.02,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Those who have seen it shall be chased after by hell's flames...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.44,0:07:33.81,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,...and wander about hell for all eternity!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.81,0:07:34.35,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.68,0:07:36.31,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,She said don't look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.31,0:07:37.49,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.69,0:07:49.95,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Ah! Kero-chan, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.95,0:07:55.83,Default,Miruku,0,0,0,,Kero! Kero!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.80,0:07:57.62,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Mikan!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.62,0:07:58.79,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Leave it to me-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.95,0:08:09.47,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.47,0:08:11.18,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I knew you could do it, Mikan-chan!{As expected of Mikan-chan.}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.18,0:08:12.89,Default,Miruko,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.52,0:08:16.35,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.04,0:08:20.11,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,I'm out of energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.39,0:08:21.18,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.18,0:08:22.19,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Curses!{Crap!}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.19,0:08:24.35,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Since Mikan split her bread with that dog,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.35,0:08:26.42,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,her strength has been snatched away!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.42,0:08:27.24,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.18,0:08:31.24,Default,Miruko,0,0,0,,Kero!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.02,0:08:35.22,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Mikan-chan, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.22,0:08:37.21,Default,Anko,0,0,0,,What do I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.21,0:08:39.83,Default,Anko,0,0,0,,If we can't find Kero-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.83,0:08:42.05,Default,Miruku,0,0,0,,Grandma will cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.60,0:08:46.08,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,The taste of human tears is like honey.{Human tears taste like honey.}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.79,0:08:48.05,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Little demons,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.05,0:08:50.75,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,when in search of beasts you have lost,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.75,0:08:52.68,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,it is best to howl loudly!{I guess howl is okay. Sounds better than wailing or bawling}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.68,0:08:53.70,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.70,0:08:56.57,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,She said we should split up and search.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.57,0:08:58.15,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,O-Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.43,0:09:00.36,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Sound good, little demons?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.66,0:09:01.49,Default,Anko,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.49,0:09:02.36,Default,Miruku,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.75,0:09:04.04,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.82,0:09:17.36,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Let us proceed, separated by this blackened river.{black / dark muddy river}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.36,0:09:19.91,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,We'll search this side of the river and they'll search on that side.{Let's split up and search both sides of the river.}{We'll split up to different sides of the river.}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.91,0:09:20.92,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Got it-nano.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.32,0:09:23.45,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Now then, let us go, little demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.80,0:09:33.01,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,We've got this side-nano.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.78,0:09:35.89,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,You're amazing, Mikan-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.89,0:09:38.48,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,How are you able to understand everything Aloma says?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.99,0:09:41.56,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Because we've been together since we were young.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.56,0:09:43.17,Default,Miruku,0,0,0,,Same goes for Anko and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.17,0:09:44.19,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.19,0:09:49.66,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,You know, that was the first time I've heard Aloma speak normally.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.18,0:09:52.00,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,{\i1}D-Don't look!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.62,0:09:54.88,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,She used to talk like that{normally} a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.88,0:09:56.04,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.04,0:09:57.83,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,When was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.14,0:10:00.96,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Mikan first met Aloma when...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.51,0:10:03.42,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,...Mikan{would use she to keep 3rd person, but she would easily be misunderstood} was five.{an alternative would be Mikan was five when... she first met Aloma.}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.95,0:10:06.09,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Back then Mikan looked like a boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.09,0:10:09.76,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,and Aloma was a really cute and timid little girl.{quiet and reserved.\NShe was really cute.}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.68,0:10:15.86,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,But, since{as} we both loved watching{alt: to watch (dono which sounds better)} PriPara TV,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.86,0:10:19.34,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,we got along well and eventually became great friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.49,0:10:27.07,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,So I drew the two of us singing PriPara in my drawing book as a present.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.83,0:10:31.53,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,{\i1}When we get older, let's sing PriPara together-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.57,0:10:35.99,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,{\i1}Aloma can't sing.{TLC: she literally says won't sing, but I feel like this is more of a can't situation}{she sope 3rd person back in the day too?!?! omg}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.92,0:10:38.81,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,She turned me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.81,0:10:39.96,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.38,0:10:43.88,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Because she wasn't very good at talking loudly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.88,0:10:45.38,Default,Miruku,0,0,0,,Just like Anko!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.38,0:10:46.92,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I'm the opposite.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.48,0:10:48.85,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.85,0:10:51.38,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,during one of our show and tells,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.38,0:10:54.61,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Aloma was chosen to play the role of a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.82,0:11:05.55,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,{\i1}My birthdate is June 6th.{need a slightly different phrasing cause of the nari}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.55,0:11:08.03,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mine is June 6th, too...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.26,0:11:12.74,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,{\i1}I am a demon.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.11,0:11:17.16,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,{\i1}Devidevi! Throw wide the gates of darkness!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.98,0:11:21.58,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,{\i1}Aloma found her outdoor voice!{her big voice came out!}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.58,0:11:23.49,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,{\i1}Devi!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.49,0:11:27.18,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Aloma did a great job playing the role of a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.20,0:11:32.37,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,{From that day on}After that, she looked up all kinds of things about demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.21,0:11:37.38,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,And that's about the time she started writing her prophecy grimoires-nano.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.84,0:11:43.39,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,When Aloma became a demon and started talking with a louder voice,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.76,0:11:47.36,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,the two of us started pretending\Nto be demon and angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.36,0:11:52.19,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,{\i1} Huh? Become demon and angel idols?{173}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.19,0:11:53.74,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.74,0:11:56.78,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,{\i1}One day we shall rule over PriPara.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.78,0:11:59.66,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's why I want you to be an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.66,0:12:01.14,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,{\i1}Okay-nano!{Got it.}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.14,0:12:05.60,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,{\i1}If that's what you want,\Nwe shall play demon and angel together!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.96,0:12:14.30,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,And ever since then{that}, Aloma has always spoken like a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.30,0:12:16.01,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,How interesting.{I see/so that's what happened}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.38,0:12:19.69,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,You really love Aloma-chan, don't you, Mikan-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.69,0:12:22.43,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,You even became an angel so you could be together.{And because of that, you became an angel\Nso you could be together.}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.43,0:12:23.38,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.38,0:12:24.73,Default,Miruku,0,0,0,,What a nice story...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.26,0:12:27.19,Default,Miruku,0,0,0,,But we're looking for Kero, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.63,0:12:30.65,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,C-Capisce.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.44,0:12:32.92,Default,Anko,0,0,0,,Kero...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.03,0:12:37.11,Default,Anko,0,0,0,,Where are you, Kero?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.11,0:12:40.58,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,My little demon, the dog won't be able to hear thee like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.58,0:12:42.38,Default,Anko,0,0,0,,Kero...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.38,0:12:44.87,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Thou need to yell louder.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.87,0:12:46.72,Default,Anko,0,0,0,,This is the best I can do.{any louder than this isn't possible}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.29,0:12:51.49,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Then I shall bestow power upon thee.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.49,0:12:52.25,Default,Anko,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.61,0:12:56.97,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Demon Demon Deruderu Beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.28,0:13:02.39,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,All right, I've implanted a demonic voice within thee.{a voice with hell's strength}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.20,0:13:04.67,Default,Anko,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.67,0:13:06.35,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Thou want to reach Kero, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.50,0:13:08.32,Default,Anko,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.77,0:13:13.54,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Now call to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.54,0:13:14.41,Default,Anko,0,0,0,,O-Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.41,0:13:18.28,Default,Anko,0,0,0,,B-But I'm {TLC: worried}afraid to, so yell with me, Onee-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.28,0:13:19.78,Default,Anko,0,0,0,,Don't call me Onee-chan.{I'm not your Onee-chan.}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.78,0:13:20.38,Default,Anko,0,0,0,,Call me Demon.{I'm a demon.}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.38,0:13:21.94,Default,Anko,0,0,0,,Then as Demon...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.94,0:13:25.38,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Well, thou are my little demon, so we shall do it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.01,0:13:31.17,Default,Anko,0,0,0,,Kero!{I dono if we can do anything fade like with the echo?}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.27,0:13:36.29,Default,Anko,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.29,0:13:38.14,Default,Anko,0,0,0,,That felt great!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.16,0:13:45.73,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.73,0:13:48.32,Default,Anko,0,0,0,,But you said you'd do it with me, Demon-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.32,0:13:50.70,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Thou shouldn't trust a demon so easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.70,0:13:52.48,Default,Anko,0,0,0,,How mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.48,0:13:54.44,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,It's thine fault for believing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.44,0:13:55.15,Default,Anko,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.15,0:13:57.40,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,What's "Kero"?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.00,0:14:05.37,Default,Miruku,0,0,0,,I wonder where Kero went.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.37,0:14:07.52,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Miruku-chan, you need to stay optimistic-nano.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.52,0:14:10.05,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,We'll continue looking for him once we finish our break.{We'll start looking for him again\Nafter we rest for a moment.}{after this break we'll go look for him again}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.05,0:14:11.33,Default,Miruku,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.67,0:14:13.05,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,But I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.05,0:14:20.25,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I was {really }worried that Aloma-chan was\Nthreatening you with a lifelong curse, Mikan-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.25,0:14:21.55,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,She wouldn't do that.{It's not like that}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.89,0:14:24.51,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Huh? Lala-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.51,0:14:26.81,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Dorthy-san. Leona-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.81,0:14:29.09,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,It's strange to see you with Mikan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.09,0:14:30.76,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,What are you girls up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.76,0:14:33.65,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,A-Actually, have either of you seen a dog around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.65,0:14:34.23,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.54,0:14:35.98,Default,Miruku,0,0,0,,His name's Kero.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.98,0:14:38.09,Default,Miruku,0,0,0,,He kind of looks like a frog{his face looks like a frog},
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.09,0:14:39.44,Default,Miruku,0,0,0,,and he's about this big.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.44,0:14:41.07,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.07,0:14:43.20,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Could it have been the dog we saw a little bit ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.20,0:14:45.86,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,You even said it looked like an eel.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.86,0:14:46.89,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.89,0:14:48.83,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Now that you say frog, it kind of did.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.83,0:14:49.41,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.41,0:14:50.87,Default,Milaku,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.56,0:14:58.96,Default,Miruku,0,0,0,,Ah, it's Kero!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.96,0:15:00.24,Default,Miruku,0,0,0,,We really was here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.24,0:15:01.59,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.44,0:15:06.67,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Hold on-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.67,0:15:08.40,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Kero!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.02,0:15:14.15,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Kero!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.15,0:15:15.23,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,I got ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.23,0:15:18.32,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,All right, time to take you back to your grandma's place-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.88,0:15:23.45,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Gel!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.03,0:15:25.42,Default,Shopkeeper,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.42,0:15:26.41,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Mikan-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.41,0:15:31.89,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,No way-nano! Snakes are...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.87,0:15:36.19,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,P-Please help her, shopkeeper{-san}!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.19,0:15:37.63,Default,Miruku,0,0,0,,Please!{help her}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.63,0:15:38.84,Default,Mila,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.84,0:15:40.25,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Mikan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.05,0:15:43.79,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Save me-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.07,0:15:47.76,Default,Anko,0,0,0,,Please save her, Demon-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.76,0:15:49.43,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,I'm also...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.43,0:15:51.24,Default,Anko,0,0,0,,You'll be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.24,0:15:55.27,Default,Anko,0,0,0,,Demon Demon Deruderu Beam!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.73,0:15:58.57,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I-I'm coming, Mikan-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.57,0:16:01.78,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,H-Hey! Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.78,0:16:03.53,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,My descendents{familiars} of darkness!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.86,0:16:04.99,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Aloma!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.99,0:16:06.37,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Aloma-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.88,0:16:11.25,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Those who have been revived from the depths of the ancient darkness, I command ye!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.25,0:16:13.51,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Return to the nest{bed} from whence ye came!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.51,0:16:15.04,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Deroderosaimu!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.04,0:16:17.44,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,I am a demon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.44,0:16:19.00,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Derodero derosaimu!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.40,0:16:23.16,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Derodero... derosaimu...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.62,0:16:28.17,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Dero... dero...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.64,0:16:32.14,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,D-Devi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.14,0:16:33.60,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Aloma!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.01,0:16:37.29,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Return to the nest from whence ye came.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.29,0:16:38.75,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Aloma-chan, in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.75,0:16:39.56,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Devi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.75,0:16:44.67,Default,Miruku,0,0,0,,Don't run away again, Kero.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.67,0:16:45.52,Default,Dog,0,0,0,,Kero?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.49,0:16:48.32,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Aloma!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.32,0:16:49.79,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Thank you-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.79,0:16:51.41,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,You really are nice-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.74,0:16:55.37,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,If you underestimate me, I'll curse you for life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.37,0:16:56.29,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.29,0:16:57.83,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Curse you for life?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.83,0:17:01.13,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,You see, it means{she said} they'll be friends forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.13,0:17:01.88,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.88,0:17:04.34,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,You understand what Aloma-chan's saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.65,0:17:06.30,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,A little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.58,0:17:10.40,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Kurosu-san is nicer than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.40,0:17:11.22,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,She's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.53,0:17:12.25,Default,Others,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.25,0:17:15.18,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,President, Sophie-san... When did you two get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.18,0:17:16.54,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,More importantly,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.54,0:17:19.33,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,our PriPara concert is about to start,\Nso we have to get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.33,0:17:20.77,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Oh, you're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.77,0:17:22.90,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Let's all go to PriPara together!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.90,0:17:24.69,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Aloma-chan! Mikan-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.69,0:17:25.79,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.79,0:17:28.70,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,We shall head to hell together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.74,0:17:35.75,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Please scan the appropriate number\Nof My Tickets for your coord.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.58,0:17:39.00,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.71,0:17:41.58,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Coord Change Start!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.18,0:17:49.72,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Sweet Angel White Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.12,0:17:52.55,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Cheeky Little Succubus Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.02,0:17:54.80,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,{\pos(323,687)}Gel!{same time / split and put under them}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.02,0:17:54.80,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,{\pos(963,687)}Devi!{same time / split and put under them}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.31,0:18:44.45,Default,Alomagedon,0,0,0,,Making Drama Switch On!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.05,0:18:45.90,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.74,0:18:47.61,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.44,0:18:51.11,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Go for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.75,0:18:56.33,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Fresh Happiness Angel à la mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.33,0:18:57.89,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Don't mind if I do{\fscx300}-
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.68,0:19:02.87,Default,Alomagedon,0,0,0,,Delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.34,0:19:08.11,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Go, my servants!{I almost want to change this to Heed my call, my servants}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.11,0:19:10.80,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,When called, we'll fly out!{Consistency with previous episodes plz QC}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.80,0:19:12.51,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Huh?{Eeeek!}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.21,0:19:18.54,Default,Alomagedon,0,0,0,,Dazzling PriParapedia Labyrinth!{めくるめく ﾌﾟﾘﾊﾟﾗﾍﾟﾃﾞｨｱﾗﾋﾞﾘﾝｽ！}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.54,0:19:20.59,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,How fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.04,0:19:25.37,Default,Alomagedon,0,0,0,,Cyalume Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.61,0:19:32.03,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Gel!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.40,0:19:53.00,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,May ye rest in hell, my little lambs.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.00,0:19:55.48,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,May heaven bless all of you.{Let heaven bless all of you.}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.09,0:19:58.54,Default,Anko,0,0,0,,Devil-san is so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.54,0:19:59.35,Default,Miruku,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.68,0:20:03.41,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Both Aloma-chan and Mikan-chan are shining with friendship power!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.41,0:20:05.26,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,They sure are dedicated!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.26,0:20:07.17,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I-I suppose they are-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.17,0:20:09.32,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,This isn't the time to be awestruck-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.68,0:20:14.78,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,There are five person teams entering the\NDream Theatre Concert left and right-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.12,0:20:17.42,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,You guys need to figure out what you're doing on the double-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.42,0:20:18.58,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Shut it-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.58,0:20:19.74,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,We already know-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.74,0:20:22.11,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Alomagedon isn't that bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.11,0:20:23.32,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Suppose so.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.32,0:20:24.70,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Don't you agree, Leona?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.70,0:20:25.79,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,If you both say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.17,0:20:28.46,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,I agree-usa! They're great-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.46,0:20:30.06,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Teamwork.{lit is like.. everyone's working together for one purpose}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.06,0:20:33.67,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,It's time for Dressing Parfait to work on forming a Dream Team!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.67,0:20:34.65,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,To the max!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.65,0:20:36.01,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.37,0:20:39.18,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Angel snap!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.18,0:20:41.18,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Demon snap.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.05,0:20:46.26,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,The time when we reign over PriPara is steadily approaching.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.26,0:20:48.40,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,We await god's blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.86,0:20:55.82,Default,Anko,0,0,0,,Now, you three, leave from this demonic country and become friends with everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.82,0:20:56.94,Default,Miruku,0,0,0,,I will-saru.{monkey}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.94,0:20:58.45,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,I will-kiji.{Japanese pheasant}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.24,0:21:00.81,Default,Rand1,0,0,0,,Momotaro-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.81,0:21:02.20,Default,Rand2,0,0,0,,That was entertaining!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.20,0:21:06.18,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,For an ogre, a demon, and an angel to become friends...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.18,0:21:07.84,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,What a wonderful play.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.84,0:21:09.59,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Aloma wrote it-nano{the script-nano}.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.59,0:21:11.17,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Ah, that makes sense.{Ah, I see}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.17,0:21:13.85,Default,Miruku,0,0,0,,Thanks, Onee-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.85,0:21:15.84,Default,Anko,0,0,0,,Be cursed forever!{lifelong curse thing.... fuck this continuing item...}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.94,0:21:18.29,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Don't act so friendly.{Don't say something so friendly}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.29,0:21:19.80,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Leave it to us-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.06,0:21:23.66,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,So President, Sophie-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.66,0:21:28.10,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I'd really like to team up with Aloma-chan and Mikan-chan.{I'd really like to be on the same team as Aloma-chan and Mikan-chan.}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.10,0:21:29.07,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.07,0:21:29.77,Default,Sophie,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.23,0:21:33.98,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose they have their good points.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.58,0:23:07.87,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Gel-gel!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.87,0:23:09.90,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,It's almost June 6th!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.90,0:23:12.00,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Which means it's almost Aloma's birthday-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.00,0:23:13.75,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Then we need to have a party!{celebration}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.75,0:23:16.37,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Will you help me with the party?{with the preparations for it}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.37,0:23:17.38,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Capisce!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.38,0:23:20.01,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,You shouldn't be{act} so happy about it-pri.{You shouldn't be so openly happy about it-pri.}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.01,0:23:21.76,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,You've got it all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.76,0:23:23.59,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Let's go to the party together.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.59,0:23:26.82,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,That way we can catch Alomagedon\Nand form a Dream Team.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.82,0:23:29.15,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,I'm against it-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.15,0:23:29.91,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Next time:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.91,0:23:31.85,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Keep it a Secret From Aloma-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.85,0:23:33.18,Default,All,0,0,0,,Aim for your dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.18,0:23:34.81,Default,All,0,0,0,,Let's go PriPara!
